; A backup of this station's keys and held cards.
FORM BACKUP
TITLE Back up this station
SUMMARY Writes your station keys and the cards you hold to a file, enciphered with a passphrase you choose. Keep it apart from the box.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 90
ACTION station_backup
FIELD passphrase Passphrase(X) required secret check=passphrase
FIELD again Passphrase again(X) required secret again=passphrase
FIELD out Write it to(X) required check=path
BEGIN_HELP
Passphrase:
12 characters or more. Without it the backup can't be read, by you or anyone.
END
